Forge-thread placement corpus: third-party excerpts
====================================================

The files under files/ are excerpts (about 220 lines each) of source files as they were at the
head of public pull requests, used only as test fixtures for revuey's placement of GitHub review
threads (tests/forge_corpus_spec.lua, tests/forge_corpus_e2e_spec.lua). cases.json holds, for
each excerpt, the review thread's position (path, line numbers renumbered to the excerpt, the
diff hunk GitHub stores with the thread) and the expected placement. No authors, logins or
comment bodies are included. The excerpts are unmodified apart from being cut; each case names
its source repository, pull request, path and the offset of the excerpt in the original file.

